classDiagram
direction LR
class TranscriptionSettings {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str model
  +str region
  +AuthMode auth_mode
  +AudioRecord audio
  +RecognitionOptions recognition_options
  +EnhancementConfig enhancement
}
class Draft {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str id
  +TranscriptionSettings config
  +dict form
  +dict summary
  +Path json_base
  +Path document_base
}
class JobConfig {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str job_id
  +str json_directory
  +str document_directory
  +CONFIGURED status
  +True execution_authorized
  +str confirmed_at
}
class ConfirmationReceipt {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str session_id
  +str job_id
  +str config_path
  +AuthMode auth_mode
  +str json_directory
  +str document_directory
  +bool execution_started
}
class SessionConnection {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +int port
  +str token
  +int pid
  +float deadline
}
class SessionTerminal {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +SessionEndState state
  +ConfirmationReceipt_or_None receipt
}
class ExecutionReport {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str job_id
  +Literal status
  +ResultSummary result
  +ErrorReport error
  +ErrorReport record_error
  +DeliveryReport delivery
  +bool documents_ready
}
class DeliveryReport {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +Literal status
  +str message
  +dict files
}
TranscriptionSettings <|-- JobConfig
Draft --> TranscriptionSettings : 已校验输入
JobConfig ..> ConfirmationReceipt : 交接回执
SessionTerminal --> ConfirmationReceipt : handed_off包含任务回执
JobConfig ..> ExecutionReport : 仅一次执行
ExecutionReport --> DeliveryReport : JSON成功后的文档结果
note for Draft "application/session.py<br/>id为预览版本；form保存可恢复输入<br/>预览不含job_id，不在磁盘保存每次编辑<br/>preview_ready登记展示；edit使该版本失效"
note for JobConfig "models.py；utils/job_files.py<br/>继承已校验输入，交接时生成编号与输出路径<br/>配置和SHA发布一次，授权为True<br/>Key独立保存在运行目录.env，执行时读取"
note for ConfirmationReceipt "utils/session_files.py<br/>sessions/session_id/receipt.json持久保存对应关系<br/>响应丢失或服务退出后返回同一job_id<br/>execution_started描述交接当时，不是实时进度"
note for SessionTerminal "state为handed_off、expired、cancelled<br/>编辑终态经web.py的SSE发送一次<br/>没有heartbeat或云端状态字段"
note for ExecutionReport "models.py<br/>result、error、record_error、delivery等为可选字段<br/>delivery.files各格式记录READY或FAILED、路径或错误<br/>documents_ready仅在COMPLETE时为true"

note for SessionConnection "utils/session_files.py<br/>私有sessions/session_id/connection.json<br/>端口与令牌用于本机控制；PID与deadline用于残留回收<br/>结束清理后移除；正式交接回执仍保留"
